  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44115570",
      "title": "A Possible, But Not Ideal Way Of Extending Built-in Elements",
      "lectureOrder": 105,
      "videoOrder": 99,
      "sourceHash": "d42ecf76822664b5e167f17c46fd6946d879a0cd3d2c30ef406abc0306b30b7c",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.939,
          "end": 3.09,
          "en": "[Maximilian Schwarzmuller] So, we got this button here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.09,
          "end": 6.15,
          "en": "and we, in the end, got the same kind of button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.15,
          "end": 8.49,
          "en": "in the header component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.49,
          "end": 11.34,
          "en": "It's essentially the same markup, just some different text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.34,
          "end": 12.603,
          "en": "and a different icon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.95,
          "end": 16.62,
          "en": "Therefore, we could strongly consider",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.62,
          "end": 18.933,
          "en": "creating a reusable component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.16,
          "end": 21.93,
          "en": "and that's what I'll do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.93,
          "end": 23.52,
          "en": "I'll generate a new component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 23.52,
          "end": 25.8,
          "en": "and I'll generate it in a shared folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 25.8,
          "end": 27.42,
          "en": "which doesn't exist yet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 27.42,
          "end": 31.59,
          "en": "because my button does not just belong to the dashboard.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 31.59,
          "end": 33.78,
          "en": "Instead, it's a shared Component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 33.78,
          "end": 37.62,
          "en": "that could be used anywhere in the application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 37.62,
          "end": 41.52,
          "en": "And I prefer to store such shared Components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.52,
          "end": 43.11,
          "en": "in a folder named shared,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.11,
          "end": 45.57,
          "en": "though that's just a personal preference",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 45.57,
          "end": 47.583,
          "en": "and not something you have to follow.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 48.54,
          "end": 50.28,
          "en": "But here I'll go for the shared folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 50.28,
          "end": 53.82,
          "en": "and then in there add a button, a button component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 53.82,
          "end": 56.343,
          "en": "and I'll skip the test files as always.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 58.41,
          "end": 61.53,
          "en": "Now, this generates me a new shared folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 61.53,
          "end": 63.183,
          "en": "with that button component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 64.74,
          "end": 67.59,
          "en": "and we can now go to the header component, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 67.59,
          "end": 69.64,
          "en": "and grab that button markup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 71.03999999999999,
          "end": 74.103,
          "en": "and bring that over into that button component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 75.03,
          "end": 79.17,
          "en": "Or at least that is something we could do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 79.17,
          "end": 81.24,
          "en": "But now here's a new pattern",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 81.24,
          "end": 82.89,
          "en": "which you haven't seen before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 82.89,
          "end": 85.65,
          "en": "when it comes to creating Components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 85.65,
          "end": 87.36,
          "en": "because what would happen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 87.36,
          "end": 90.213,
          "en": "if we would set up this button like this?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 91.17,
          "end": 96.17,
          "en": "Well, we would end up with a custom app button component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 96.47999999999999,
          "end": 98.19,
          "en": "this selector here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 98.19,
          "end": 102.09,
          "en": "and we could use that anywhere where we want such a button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 102.09,
          "end": 104.00999999999999,
          "en": "Now, let's do this real quick",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 104.00999999999999,
          "end": 107.1,
          "en": "to see what that gives us in the DOM.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 107.1,
          "end": 109.65,
          "en": "So I'll go to that header component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 109.65,
          "end": 111.69,
          "en": "and I'll replace that button here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 111.69,
          "end": 114.423,
          "en": "with my app button like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 115.47,
          "end": 118.41,
          "en": "and I'll then import this app button here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 118.41,
          "end": 120.873,
          "en": "to make it available in the header component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 122.28,
          "end": 124.74,
          "en": "Now, since I just copy and pasted the markup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 124.74,
          "end": 126.57,
          "en": "that was previously the header,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 126.57,
          "end": 129.123,
          "en": "this button will still look the way it did before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 130.68,
          "end": 133.05,
          "en": "So if we now save that and reload, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 133.05,
          "end": 135.423,
          "en": "the UI looks as it did before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 136.56,
          "end": 141.12,
          "en": "But let's now inspect that button here with the DAF tools.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 141.12,
          "end": 144.84,
          "en": "If we do that, we can see that button element here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 144.84,
          "end": 148.07999999999998,
          "en": "but we can also see something else that's interesting,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 148.07999999999998,
          "end": 150.3,
          "en": "the app button element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 150.3,
          "end": 154.32,
          "en": "So, our component element is also here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 154.32,
          "end": 159.32,
          "en": "and that's really important to understand in Angular.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 159.48,
          "end": 164.4,
          "en": "Your component elements do end up in the real DOM.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 164.4,
          "end": 166.11,
          "en": "You can see them everywhere,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 166.11,
          "end": 170.88,
          "en": "app header, app button, and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 170.88,
          "end": 174.66,
          "en": "And in the main section you'd find the app dashboard item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 174.66,
          "end": 175.503,
          "en": "and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 176.67000000000002,
          "end": 181.67,
          "en": "So your component elements are not compiled away",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 182.07,
          "end": 186.96,
          "en": "or replaced with the template content by Angular.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 186.96,
          "end": 189.39,
          "en": "Instead, they are rendered to the DOM,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 189.39,
          "end": 192.753,
          "en": "and the template content is then nested inside of them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 193.83,
          "end": 197.22,
          "en": "Now, that's no problem or anything like that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 197.22,
          "end": 201.45,
          "en": "but it means that we sometimes have some redundant,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 201.45,
          "end": 204.66,
          "en": "unnecessary element in the DOM,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 204.66,
          "end": 207.18,
          "en": "like here with the app button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 207.18,
          "end": 210.57,
          "en": "It's, in the end, some unnecessary duplication,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 210.57,
          "end": 212.1,
          "en": "which we have here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 212.1,
          "end": 215.88,
          "en": "having a wrapper that's almost named button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 215.88,
          "end": 218.7,
          "en": "around an element that's named button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 218.7,
          "end": 220.47,
          "en": "Sure, we can do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 220.47,
          "end": 222.78,
          "en": "As you see, we get the intended result.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 222.78,
          "end": 224.7,
          "en": "It looks good.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 224.7,
          "end": 227.52,
          "en": "But we can actually change our code here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 227.52,
          "end": 229.95,
          "en": "to end up with a leaner DOM,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 229.95,
          "end": 231.93,
          "en": "because what we essentially wanna do here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 231.93,
          "end": 234.27,
          "en": "with that button component is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 234.27,
          "end": 239.27,
          "en": "that we wanna kind of extend the built-in button component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 239.31,
          "end": 242.07,
          "en": "I want to keep all its capabilities.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 242.07,
          "end": 243.63,
          "en": "I want to be able to listen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 243.63,
          "end": 246.84,
          "en": "to all its events if needed and so on,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 246.84,
          "end": 248.94,
          "en": "but I want to extend it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 248.94,
          "end": 251.1,
          "en": "because I want to have more control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 251.1,
          "end": 254.01,
          "en": "over its markup in this case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 254.01,
          "end": 256.44,
          "en": "And if you have a situation like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 256.44,
          "end": 260.76,
          "en": "where you essentially want to extend a built-in component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 260.76,
          "end": 265.203,
          "en": "you can follow a slightly different approach to building it.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
